OL,3,GNEWSADozens of firefighters tackle
OL,4,Ahouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FMultiple crews have been at the scene
OL,7,Fof a house fire in Birmingham.
OL,9,FWest Midlands Fire Service (WMFS) said
OL,10,F10 fire engines attended the blaze in
OL,11,FDrayton Road in Kings Heath on Saturday
OL,12,Fnight.
OL,14,FIn an updated post at 23:09 BST, the
OL,15,Fservice advised people living or
OL,16,Fworking nearby to keep their doors and
OL,17,Fwindows closed as a precaution.
OL,19,FBBC Newsbeat journalist Peter
OL,20,FGillibrand, who witnessed the fire,
OL,21,Fsaid he had seen "embers flying up from
OL,22,Fthe roof amid the smoke".
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
